  "contract": [
    "Run ParserOperation and ParserHints against the dca parser opened at offset zero with default flags. Feed equally sized contiguous windows with a final short window and explicit EOF flush.",
    "Fold kind 1 with the packet's physical offset, byte count, duration, latched rate, profile, frame_offset, cur_offset, next_frame_offset and every source byte. Numeric parser hints retain their signed values.",
    "The candidate folds kind 8 for an unsupported clock and still folds packet bytes and byte hints. Source frame observations, parser clock disposition and hint origin appear only in trace diagnostics. Fold terminal kind 7 on EOF or 8 on a parser-view refusal."
  ],
